<h2>Introduction</h2>
<p>
  XQ Tech Solutions ("we," "our," or "us") operates the Refresh mobile and web application
  (the "App"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard
  your information when you use Refresh.
</p>
<p>
  Refresh is a healthy-meal service: you order chef-made meals or build your own with live
  macros, and collect them at the partner gym you select. This policy is written to comply
  with the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act) and the Information
  Technology Act, 2000.
</p>
<p>
  By using Refresh, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with
  this Privacy Policy.
</p>

<hr />

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>

<h3>1. Account Information</h3>
<p>When you sign in and use Refresh, we collect:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Google Sign-In:</strong> Your name and email address from your Google account, used to create and secure your account</li>
  <li><strong>Phone Number (optional):</strong> Only if you add it — used to send you SMS alerts about your orders and deliveries</li>
  <li><strong>Profile Photo (optional):</strong> A profile image you choose to upload</li>
  <li><strong>Your Gym:</strong> The partner gym you select as your delivery point</li>
</ul>

<h3>2. Order and Meal Data</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Orders &amp; Deliveries:</strong> Meals ordered, delivery days and time slots, order amounts, and delivery status</li>
  <li><strong>Saved Meals:</strong> Meals you build or save in the app, including chosen foods and portions</li>
  <li><strong>Wallet:</strong> Your in-app wallet balance and credit history (wallet credits are usable on orders · not withdrawable)</li>
</ul>

<h3>3. Payment Information</h3>
<p>
  Payments are processed by our payment provider, <strong>Razorpay</strong>. We receive a
  payment confirmation and a reference for reconciliation. <strong>Card numbers, UPI
  credentials, and bank details never touch our servers</strong> — they are handled directly
  by Razorpay under their own privacy policy.
</p>

<h3>4. Device and Usage Information</h3>
<p>We automatically collect:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Device type, operating system, and app version</li>
  <li><strong>Usage &amp; Diagnostics:</strong> Features used, interactions, and crash/error reports to keep the app stable</li>
  <li><strong>Push Notification Token:</strong> To deliver order and delivery notifications (via Firebase Cloud Messaging)</li>
</ul>

<p>
  <strong>We do not track your device location.</strong> Refresh delivers to your chosen
  partner gym, not to a personal address, so we do not need or collect GPS location data.
</p>

<hr />

<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Provide the Service:</strong> Take and fulfil your orders, prepare your meals, and deliver them to your selected gym at the right slot</li>
  <li><strong>Account Management:</strong> Manage your profile, saved meals, gym selection, and wallet</li>
  <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Send order confirmations, delivery updates, and support replies (in-app, email, and optional SMS)</li>
  <li><strong>Payments:</strong> Process payments and wallet credits, and reconcile transactions via Razorpay</li>
  <li><strong>Improve the App:</strong> Diagnose crashes and analyze usage to improve features and reliability</li>
  <li><strong>Security and Fraud Prevention:</strong> Detect and prevent misuse, fraudulent orders, and unauthorized access</li>
  <li><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> Meet obligations under applicable Indian law, including tax, accounting, and food-safety requirements</li>
</ol>

<hr />

<h2>Data Storage and Security</h2>

<h3>Storage</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Your data is stored securely on managed cloud infrastructure — <strong>Supabase</strong> (database and authentication) and <strong>Google Firebase</strong> (notifications and web hosting)</li>
  <li>Some data is cached locally on your device for performance and offline viewing</li>
  <li>Data syncs between your device and our servers when connected to the internet</li>
</ul>

<h3>Security Measures</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Authentication via Google Sign-In and Supabase Auth</li>
  <li>Row-level security so you can only access your own account data</li>
  <li>Encrypted data transmission (HTTPS / TLS)</li>
  <li>Payment processing handled by PCI-DSS compliant provider (Razorpay)</li>
  <li>Access limited to authorized personnel; regular security reviews</li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h2>Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
<p>We do <strong>NOT</strong> sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties.</p>
<p>We share your information only in these circumstances:</p>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Kitchen &amp; Delivery Staff:</strong> Our staff see only what they need to prepare and hand over your box — typically your name and order details for the relevant slot</li>
  <li><strong>Partner Gym:</strong> Your box is left for collection at your selected gym's front desk during your chosen slot</li>
  <li><strong>Payment Provider:</strong> Payment information is processed by Razorpay under its own privacy policy</li>
  <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Trusted infrastructure vendors (Supabase, Google Firebase, and error-monitoring providers) bound by confidentiality obligations</li>
  <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by Indian law, court order, or government regulation</li>
  <li><strong>Protection of Rights:</strong> To protect the rights, property, or safety of XQ Tech Solutions, our users, or others</li>
  <li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In connection with a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets (with prior notice)</li>
</ol>

<hr />

<h2>Your Rights and Choices</h2>
<p>Under the DPDP Act, 2023, you have the right to:</p>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Access:</strong> View your account data, saved meals, order history, and wallet</li>
  <li><strong>Correct &amp; Update:</strong> Edit your name, phone number, profile photo, and gym at any time</li>
  <li><strong>Delete:</strong> Request deletion of your account and personal data (see our <a href="/delete-request/refresh">Account Deletion</a> page)</li>
  <li><strong>Notifications:</strong> Manage push notification and SMS preferences</li>
  <li><strong>Withdraw Consent / Grievance:</strong> Withdraw consent or raise a grievance with our Grievance Officer (below)</li>
</ol>
<p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:xqtechsolutions@gmail.com">xqtechsolutions@gmail.com</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/916235455560">+91 6235455560</a>.</p>

<hr />

<h2>Data Retention</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Account and profile data is retained while your account is active</li>
  <li>When you delete your account, your personal details (name, photo, phone) are anonymized and your saved meals are removed — see the <a href="/delete-request/refresh">Account Deletion</a> page for exactly what is deleted versus retained</li>
  <li><strong>Order, delivery, payment, and wallet records are retained</strong> as required under Indian tax and accounting law (typically up to 7 years), and so that meals you have already paid for can still be fulfilled. These retained records are held in an anonymized form no longer linked to your identity</li>
  <li>Diagnostic and anonymized usage data may be retained for service improvement</li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>
  Refresh is not intended for use by children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly
  collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have collected such
  information, please contact us immediately for removal.
</p>

